## 🎯 Creating Your First Campaign

### Step 1: Click "Create New Campaign"

From the dashboard, click the **"Create New Campaign"** button. You'll be taken to the campaign creation wizard.

### Step 2: Campaign Brief

Fill out the campaign brief form:

#### Basic Information
```
Campaign Name: [e.g., "Summer Product Launch"]
Brand/Product: [e.g., "EcoFriendly Water Bottles"]
Target Audience: [e.g., "Health-conscious millennials aged 25-35"]
```

#### Content Goals
Choose what you want to achieve:
- 🎯 **Brand Awareness** - Get more people to know your brand
- 💰 **Sales/Conversions** - Drive purchases or sign-ups
- 📈 **Engagement** - Get likes, comments, shares
- 🎥 **Video Views** - Increase video watch time

#### Platform Selection
Select which platforms you'll be posting on:
- ✅ TikTok (Short-form videos)
- ✅ Instagram (Posts, Stories, Reels)
- ✅ YouTube (Shorts and long-form)
- ✅ Twitter/X (Tweets and threads)
- ✅ LinkedIn (Professional content)
- ✅ Facebook (Posts and videos)

#### Brand Voice & Tone
Choose your brand personality:
- **Professional** vs **Casual**
- **Funny** vs **Serious**
- **Educational** vs **Entertainment**
- **Trendy** vs **Timeless**

#### Content Constraints
Set any limitations:
- **Banned Words**: Words you never want to use
- **Brand Guidelines**: Specific phrases or messaging
- **Legal Requirements**: Disclaimers or compliance notes

### Step 3: Review and Start

Review your brief and click **"Start Campaign"**. The AI agents will begin working on your content!

