## ❓ Frequently Asked Questions

### General Questions

**Q: How much does the platform cost?**
A: We offer several pricing tiers starting from $29/month for individual creators up to enterprise plans for large teams. Check our pricing page for current rates.

**Q: Can I use this for any type of business?**
A: Yes! The platform works for e-commerce, SaaS, personal brands, agencies, non-profits, and any other type of business that needs viral content.

**Q: How long does it take to generate a campaign?**
A: Most campaigns are ready for review within 5-10 minutes. Complex campaigns with many angles may take up to 15 minutes.

**Q: Can I edit the AI-generated content?**
A: Absolutely! All content is fully editable. You can modify headlines, captions, hashtags, and schedules to match your exact needs.

### Technical Questions

**Q: Which social media platforms are supported?**
A: We support TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, Twitter/X, LinkedIn, and Facebook. More platforms are added regularly.

**Q: Do I need to connect my social media accounts?**
A: No, it's optional. You can export content and post manually, or connect accounts for automatic scheduling.

**Q: Is my data secure?**
A: Yes, we use enterprise-grade security with encryption, secure data centers, and comply with privacy regulations.

**Q: Can I cancel my subscription anytime?**
A: Yes, you can cancel your subscription at any time. Your content and data will remain accessible for 30 days after cancellation.

### Content Questions

**Q: How does the AI know what's trending?**
A: Our AI analyzes real-time data from social media platforms, news sources, and trend databases to identify viral topics.

**Q: Can I train the AI on my brand voice?**
A: Yes! You can upload examples of your content, provide feedback, and the AI will learn your specific style over time.

**Q: What if the generated content doesn't match my brand?**
A: You can always edit content manually, provide feedback to improve future generations, or adjust your brand voice settings.

**Q: How many content pieces can I generate?**
A: This depends on your subscription plan. Individual plans typically allow 50-100 pieces per month, while enterprise plans have unlimited generation.

### Integration Questions

**Q: Can I integrate with my existing tools?**
A: Yes, we integrate with popular schedulers (Buffer, Later, Hootsuite), project management tools, and analytics platforms.

**Q: Can my team collaborate on campaigns?**
A: Yes, you can invite team members, assign roles, and collaborate on campaigns in real-time.

**Q: Can I export to my preferred format?**
A: Yes, we support multiple export formats including CSV, PDF, Notion pages, Google Drive folders, and direct scheduler integration.

